00:06:01.526 --> 00:06:04.771
And I can customize
the way that Editor works.

00:06:04.771 --> 00:06:06.839
So if I really feel like,

00:06:06.839 --> 00:06:11.765
I wanna hold on to my vague
adjectives and my Oxford commas,

00:06:11.765 --> 00:06:16.112
I can do that in order to
