00:06:32.500 --> 00:06:34.880
And this sounds kind of silly,
but it sort of makes sense.

00:06:34.880 --> 00:06:36.610
It feels really
natural to use a pen,

00:06:36.610 --> 00:06:40.910
and recent research has shown
us that actually using a pen

00:06:40.910 --> 00:06:43.870
