deeply than using a mouse and

00:06:43.870 --> 00:06:45.940
keyboard, especially when
absorbing information.

00:06:47.300 --> 00:06:49.850
But with AI and
Ink Editor in Word,

00:06:49.850 --> 00:06:52.810
we can actually make using
a digital pen and ink fill as

00:06:52.810 --> 00:06:55.520
much as paper, just without
all the printing and scanning.

00:06:56.960 --> 00:07:00.270
So I can do things like,
